---
source: crates/notify/tests/payloads.rs
expression: email_snapshot(&changes(3))
---
to: owner@example.com
subject: CodoSEO: 3 changes on example.com
--- text ---
Instant alert · example.com
3 changes on example.com

[Critical] Became noindex
  https://example.com/page-0 · index → noindex
[Warning] Status changed
  https://example.com/page-1 · 200 → 500
[Notice] Title changed
  https://example.com/page-2 · index → noindex

See the changes:
https://codoseo.com/sites/abc

Sent to an alert channel on CodoSEO.

CodoSEO by SafrowLabs · https://codoseo.com

